    { date="2026-09-21", lines={ "唤魔师：修复 扭转天平 加持下施放 火焰吐息 时 拆解 不触发的问题；修复 拆解 可能漏掉部分被 火焰吐息 命中目标的问题", "地下城：修复 纳洛拉克的巢穴 / 毒牙祭坛 里跟着林多尔米指引走会在敌方军队不够时就结束地下城的问题", "剧毒深渊 · 盘蛇祭坛：修复 剧毒洪流 偶尔不生成 凝聚毒液 与 剧毒突变 的问题；修复 熔炉之牙 / 熔炉亵渎 偶尔不在平台两侧都留下禁区的问题；宠物不再能在剧情演出期间拉到 祖尔金", "剧毒深渊 · 乌拉泰克：[周维护后] 石化毒液 伤害全难度 -40%；[周维护后] 史诗难度 沸腾毒液 改为重要光环；修复 石化毒液 对远离乌拉泰克的玩家不造成伤害的问题" }, linesEn={ "Evoker: fixed Unravel not activating when Fire Breath was cast with Tip the Scales; fixed Unravel possibly missing some targets struck by Fire Breath", "Dungeons: fixed following Lindormi's Guidance in Den of Nalorakk and Altar of Fangs leading to ending the dungeon short of the enemy forces requirement", "The Venomous Abyss · The Coiled Altar: fixed a rare issue where Toxic Deluge would fail to create Coalesced Venoms and Virulent Mutations; fixed Fangs of the Crucible / Defilement of the Crucible sometimes not creating area denial on both halves of the platform; pets can no longer engage Zul'jan during the roleplay", "The Venomous Abyss · Ula'tek: [with weekly restarts] Stone Venom damage -40% on all difficulties; [with weekly restarts] Boiling Venom on Mythic is now an Important Aura; fixed Stone Venom failing to damage players far from Ula'tek" }, refs={ { { t="spell", id=370553, zh="扭转天平", en="Tip the Scales" }, { t="spell", id=357208, zh="火焰吐息", en="Fire Breath" }, { t="spell", id=1264378, zh="拆解", en="Unravel" } }, {  }, {  }, {  } } },
    { date="2026-09-15", lines={ "斯索拉克：风暴伤害英雄/史诗 -20%；英雄难度腐蚀利爪不再生成腐蚀残渣", "双子毒牙：腐蚀唾液史诗 -20%；唤醒子嗣召唤的小怪降至 10 只；脏腑爆裂读条 +0.5 秒", "盘卷祭坛：毒液爆裂英雄/史诗 -10%，诱变毒液 -15%；恐惧哀嚎读条英雄 12 秒 / 史诗 10 秒；恐惧行军目标数不再随阶段增加；打断后小怪额外可见 3 秒；史诗转场碎片 -25%", "乌拉特克史诗：腐臭薄膜 1 小时→30 秒；一阶段每波小怪 13→8、二阶段每侧 14→12、转场蛋 14→8；岩石剧毒伤害全难度下调", "乌拉特克随机团：漏站蛇母之怒只叠 1 层岩石剧毒；恶意读条 1.5→5 秒且伤害下调；二阶段小怪降至 6；无羁之怒、响尾猛击伤害下调", "射击猎：修复枪/弩的瞄准射击施法动画；防骑：奉献首跳吃到套装暴击加成；神牧：二件套「活力」不再超过 3 层", "潮汐火花补发：火花尘多于背包+装备内火花的角色，登录直接补入缺失的火花", "任务：「仍在敌后传送门」被劫持的传送门传送位置修复；地下堡重新计入「至暗角落的希望」进度；盘蛇岛诅咒涌动轮换 45→30 分钟" }, linesEn={ "Sszorak: Tempest -20% on Heroic/Mythic; Caustic Claws no longer leaves Caustic Residue on Heroic", "Twin Fangs: Corrosive Spit -20% on Mythic; Rouse the Brood spawns 10 Broodlings; Visceral Burst cast +0.5s", "Coiled Altar: Venom Rupture -10% (H/M), Mutagenic Venom -15%; Wail of Terror cast 12s (H) / 10s (M); Dreadmarch target count no longer grows; revealed adds visible +3s; Mythic intermission Fragments -25%", "Ula'tek Mythic: Putrid Membrane 1h→30s; Stage 1 adds per wave 13→8, Stage 2 per side 14→12, intermission eggs 14→8; Stone Venom damage reduced on all difficulties", "Ula'tek LFR: missing Mother's Wrath only applies 1 Stone Venom stack; Malice cast 1.5→5s and damage reduced; Stage 2 adds reduced to 6; Unchecked Rage / Rattler Slam damage reduced", "MM Hunter: Aimed Shot animation with guns/crossbows fixed; Prot Paladin: Consecration first tick gets the tier crit bonus; Holy Priest: 2pc Renewed Vigor caps at 3 stacks", "Spark of Tides catch-up: characters with more Spark Dust than sparks receive missing sparks on login", "Quests: Hijacked Portal for \"Still Behind Enemy Portals\" fixed; Delves count for \"Hope in the Darkest Corners\" again; Curse Surges rotate every 30 min (was 45)" }, refs={ { { t="spell", id=1287072, zh="风暴", en="Tempest" }, { t="spell", id=1305998, zh="腐蚀利爪", en="Caustic Claws" }, { t="spell", id=1296602, zh="腐蚀残渣", en="Caustic Residue" }, { t="spell", id=454009, zh="狂风怒号", en="Tempest" } }, { { t="spell", id=